{
  "_readme": [
    "Pages the scout reads every day for deals (stores) and dated promotions (banks, card networks, government).",
    "Only official pages on the company's own domain. The scout respects robots.txt, never leaves the domain, and publishes only what it can quote from the page.",
    "Store items become Deals for you; bank and government items become Coming up near you events for the right cardholders.",
    "issuers must match seed/card_benefits.json. card_keywords limits a promotion to cards whose name contains the word (e.g. mastercard).",
    "Pages that fail are retried weekly and show their last error in deal_sources.last_status — fix or deactivate them. Run `npm run seed:build -- --migration` after editing."
